   "subject": "Re: SparkR OCR file read",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You need to create a Hive context to read ORC files:<br><br>hiveContext &lt;- sparkRHive.init(sc)<br>d &lt;- read.df(hiveContext, &quot;/user/spark/data.orc&quot;, &quot;orc&quot;)<br>printSchema(d)</div>"
    ],
    [
